<section id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title" class="bg-cream py-24 text-espresso lg:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:0ms" class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-espresso/60">How it&#x27;s made</p><h2 id="process-title" class="mt-4 text-balance font-heading font-soft text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-medium leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]"><span data-reveal="words" class="kuro-words" style="--reveal-delay:80ms"><span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:0">From</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:1">green</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:2">bean</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:3">to</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:4">your</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:5">cup</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:6">in</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:7">four</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:8">careful</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:9">steps.</span></span></span></h2></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-5 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li data-reveal="image" style="--reveal-delay:0ms" class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgb(0_0_0/0.4)]"><img alt="Six coffee beans in a row, from pale green to dark roasted" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="kuro-reveal-media object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/images/process/roast.jpg 256w, /images/process/roast.jpg 384w, /images/process/roast.jpg 640w, /images/process/roast.jpg 750w, /images/process/roast.jpg 828w, /images/process/roast.jpg 1080w, /images/process/roast.jpg 1200w, /images/process/roast.jpg 1920w, /images/process/roast.jpg 2048w, /images/process/roast.jpg 3840w" src="/images/process/roast.jpg"/><span class="absolute left-4 top-4 grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-espresso text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-cream">01</span></div><h3 class="mt-6 font-heading font-soft text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em]">Roast</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-espresso/70 sm:text-base">Every Tuesday we roast small batches to a deep medium-dark, chasing cocoa sweetness without the bitterness.</p></li><li data-reveal="image" style="--reveal-delay:120ms" class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgb(0_0_0/0.4)]"><img alt="Roasted coffee beans poured into a golden coffee bag" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="kuro-reveal-media object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/images/process/rest.jpg 256w, /images/process/rest.jpg 384w, /images/process/rest.jpg 640w, /images/process/rest.jpg 750w, /images/process/rest.jpg 828w, /images/process/rest.jpg 1080w, /images/process/rest.jpg 1200w, /images/process/rest.jpg 1920w, /images/process/rest.jpg 2048w, /images/process/rest.jpg 3840w" src="/images/process/rest.jpg"/><span class="absolute left-4 top-4 grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-espresso text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-cream">02</span></div><h3 class="mt-6 font-heading font-soft text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em]">Rest</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-espresso/70 sm:text-base">Fresh beans rest for seven days so the gases settle and every shot pulls smooth and balanced.</p></li><li data-reveal="image" style="--reveal-delay:240ms" class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgb(0_0_0/0.4)]"><img alt="Espresso dripping from a portafilter spout" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="kuro-reveal-media object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/images/process/pull.jpg 256w, /images/process/pull.jpg 384w, /images/process/pull.jpg 640w, /images/process/pull.jpg 750w, /images/process/pull.jpg 828w, /images/process/pull.jpg 1080w, /images/process/pull.jpg 1200w, /images/process/pull.jpg 1920w, /images/process/pull.jpg 2048w, /images/process/pull.jpg 3840w" src="/images/process/pull.jpg"/><span class="absolute left-4 top-4 grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-espresso text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-cream">03</span></div><h3 class="mt-6 font-heading font-soft text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em]">Pull</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-espresso/70 sm:text-base">Each drink gets its own double shot, pulled to order with 18 grams in and 36 grams out.</p></li><li data-reveal="image" style="--reveal-delay:360ms" class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgb(0_0_0/0.4)]"><img alt="Milk being poured into a glass of iced coffee" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="kuro-reveal-media object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/images/process/pour.jpg 256w, /images/process/pour.jpg 384w, /images/process/pour.jpg 640w, /images/process/pour.jpg 750w, /images/process/pour.jpg 828w, /images/process/pour.jpg 1080w, /images/process/pour.jpg 1200w, /images/process/pour.jpg 1920w, /images/process/pour.jpg 2048w, /images/process/pour.jpg 3840w" src="/images/process/pour.jpg"/><span class="absolute left-4 top-4 grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-espresso text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-cream">04</span></div><h3 class="mt-6 font-heading font-soft text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em]">Pour</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-espresso/70 sm:text-base">The shot meets ice, cold milk and a house-made flavor, then goes straight into your hand.</p></li></ol></div></section>
